{"name":"Leon优选 零售经营","description":"订单、商品、门店、会员与区域的经营分析口径。区域、城市、门店均指履约门店，而不是客户注册地。","calendar":{"today":"2026-10-01","data_start":"2024-10-01","data_end":"2026-09-30"},"metrics":[{"key":"gmv","label":"GMV","description":"已支付订单的实付金额合计。包含之后整单退款的订单，不包含已取消（未支付）订单。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(SUM(o.pay_amount), 2)","item_expr":"ROUND(SUM(oi.pay_amount), 2)","filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"currency","unit":"","components":[],"synonyms":["GMV","成交额","成交总额","交易额","交易总额","成交金额","流水"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"net_revenue","label":"净销售额","description":"GMV 扣除退款金额，即未退款订单的实付金额合计。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(SUM(o.pay_amount - o.refund_amount), 2)","item_expr":"ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN o.status = 'refunded' THEN 0 ELSE oi.pay_amount END), 2)","filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"currency","unit":"","components":[],"synonyms":["净销售额","净成交额","净收入","实收金额"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"order_count","label":"订单数","description":"已支付订单数（含之后退款的订单，不含已取消订单）。","type":"simple","expr":"COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id)","item_expr":null,"filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"integer","unit":"单","components":[],"synonyms":["订单数","订单量","单量","下单量","成交单数","多少单"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"buyer_count","label":"下单用户数","description":"统计周期内至少有一笔已支付订单的去重用户数。","type":"simple","expr":"COUNT(DISTINCT o.customer_id)","item_expr":null,"filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"integer","unit":"人","components":[],"synonyms":["下单用户数","下单人数","购买人数","购买用户数","买家数","顾客数","客户数","消费人数"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"aov","label":"客单价","description":"GMV ÷ 下单用户数（按人计算）。按订单计算的是“笔单价”。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(SUM(o.pay_amount) * 1.0 / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.customer_id), 0), 2)","item_expr":"ROUND(SUM(oi.pay_amount) * 1.0 / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.customer_id), 0), 2)","filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"currency","unit":"","components":["gmv","buyer_count"],"synonyms":["客单价","人均消费","人均消费额"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"avg_order_value","label":"笔单价","description":"GMV ÷ 订单数（按单计算）。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(SUM(o.pay_amount) * 1.0 / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 0), 2)","item_expr":null,"filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"currency","unit":"","components":["gmv","order_count"],"synonyms":["笔单价","单均价","平均订单金额","平均每单金额","每单平均金额"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"items_sold","label":"销量","description":"已支付订单中的商品件数合计（含之后退款的订单）。","type":"simple","expr":"SUM(oi.quantity)","item_expr":"SUM(oi.quantity)","filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"integer","unit":"件","components":[],"synonyms":["销量","销售件数","售出件数","卖了多少件","件数"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"refund_amount","label":"退款金额","description":"整单退款订单的退款金额合计。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(SUM(o.refund_amount), 2)","item_expr":"ROUND(SUM(CASE WHEN o.status = 'refunded' THEN oi.pay_amount ELSE 0 END), 2)","filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"currency","unit":"","components":[],"synonyms":["退款金额","退款额","退款总额","退了多少钱"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"refund_rate","label":"退款率","description":"退款订单数 ÷ 已支付订单数（按单量计算，不是按金额）。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(COUNT(DISTINCT CASE WHEN o.status = 'refunded' THEN o.order_id END) * 1.0 / NULLIF(COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id), 0), 4)","item_expr":null,"filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"percent","unit":"","components":["refunded_orders","order_count"],"synonyms":["退款率","退单率","退货率","退款订单数","退款单数","退单数"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"repurchase_rate","label":"复购率","description":"统计周期内下单 2 次及以上的用户数 ÷ 统计周期内下单用户数。按维度拆分时在每个分组内分别计算。","type":"repurchase","expr":null,"item_expr":null,"filter":"o.status IN ('paid', 'refunded')","format":"percent","unit":"","components":["repeat_buyers","buyer_count"],"synonyms":["复购率","回购率","重复购买率","复购"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","member_level","age_band","month"],"requires":null,"accessible":true},{"key":"gross_profit","label":"毛利额","description":"已支付且未退款订单的商品实付 − 件数 × 成本价。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(SUM(oi.pay_amount - oi.quantity * p.unit_cost), 2)","item_expr":"ROUND(SUM(oi.pay_amount - oi.quantity * p.unit_cost), 2)","filter":"o.status = 'paid'","format":"currency","unit":"","components":[],"synonyms":["毛利额","毛利润","毛利"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":"cost","accessible":true},{"key":"gross_margin","label":"毛利率","description":"毛利额 ÷ 已支付且未退款订单的商品实付。","type":"simple","expr":"ROUND(SUM(oi.pay_amount - oi.quantity * p.unit_cost) * 1.0 / NULLIF(SUM(oi.pay_amount), 0), 4)","item_expr":"ROUND(SUM(oi.pay_amount - oi.quantity * p.unit_cost) * 1.0 / NULLIF(SUM(oi.pay_amount), 0), 4)","filter":"o.status = 'paid'","format":"percent","unit":"","components":["gross_profit","paid_sales"],"synonyms":["毛利率"],"dimensions":["region","city","store","channel","category","brand","product","member_level","age_band","month","date"],"requires":"cost","accessible":true}],"dimensions":[{"key":"region","label":"区域","expr":"r.region_name","table":"regions","description":"履约门店所在区域","synonyms":["区域","大区","地区","片区"],"values":["华东","华南","华北","华中","西南","西北","东北"],"grain":"order","time_grain":null},{"key":"city","label":"城市","expr":"s.city","table":"stores","description":"履约门店所在城市","synonyms":["城市"],"values":["上海","杭州","南京","苏州","广州","深圳","厦门","北京","天津","石家庄","武汉","长沙","郑州","成都","重庆","昆明","西安","兰州","沈阳","哈尔滨","大连"],"grain":"order","time_grain":null},{"key":"store","label":"门店","expr":"s.store_name","table":"stores","description":"","synonyms":["门店","店铺","分店"],"values":["上海徐汇店","上海浦东店","杭州西湖店","南京新街口店","苏州园区店","广州天河店","深圳南山店","深圳福田店","厦门思明店","北京朝阳店","北京海淀店","天津和平店","石家庄长安店","武汉光谷店","长沙五一店","郑州二七店","成都春熙店","重庆解放碑店","昆明翠湖店","西安小寨店","兰州西关店","沈阳中街店","哈尔滨中央大街店","大连星海店"],"grain":"order","time_grain":null},{"key":"channel","label":"渠道","expr":"o.channel","table":"orders","description":"","synonyms":["渠道","下单渠道","销售渠道"],"values":["线下门店","小程序","App"],"grain":"order","time_grain":null},{"key":"category","label":"品类","expr":"p.category","table":"products","description":"","synonyms":["品类","类目","商品类别","大类"],"values":["生鲜","食品饮料","日用百货","美妆个护","母婴","数码家电"],"grain":"item","time_grain":null},{"key":"brand","label":"品牌","expr":"p.brand","table":"products","description":"","synonyms":["品牌"],"values":["Leon Fresh","Mia Farm","Leon Select","Noah Snacks","Emma Home","Iris Beauty","Ava Care","Noah Kids","Lily Baby","Jack Digital","Max Tech"],"grain":"item","time_grain":null},{"key":"product","label":"商品","expr":"p.product_name","table":"products","description":"","synonyms":["商品","单品","产品","SKU","货品"],"values":[],"grain":"item","time_grain":null},{"key":"member_level","label":"会员等级","expr":"c.member_level","table":"customers","description":"","synonyms":["会员等级","会员级别","会员类型"],"values":["普通会员","银卡会员","金卡会员","黑金会员"],"grain":"order","t